articles.summary:
On 2 June 2026, the Committee on Budgetary Control voted on opinions related to the multiannual financial framework (MMF) for the years 2028 to 2034.

The following draft Opinions were voted:
Opinion to CULT on establishing the Erasmus+ programme;
Opinion to ENVI-SANT on Union Civil Protection Mechanism and Union support for health emergency preparedness and response;
Opinion to AFET-DEVE on establishing Global Europe;
Opinion to CULT-LIBE on establishing the 'AgoraEU' programme;
Opinion to IMCO
